@startuml F7.4-D02-criar-request-type
title F7.4-D02 — Criar RequestType (DRAFT)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RTController" as Ctrl
participant "CreateRTUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Criar e salvar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /request-types
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
note right of UC
  valida schemas
end note
UC -> Postgres: INSERT DRAFT\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Admin: tipo DRAFT na lista

@enduml
